TITLE Fe redox speciation with minerals at 100 C
SOLUTION 1 Pure water pH 3
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file fe_speciation.sel
    -reset false
    -totals Fe(+2) Fe(+3)
    -molalities Fe+2 Fe+3 FeOH+ FeOH+2 Fe(OH)2+ Fe(OH)3 Fe(OH)4- FeSO4 FeSO4+ FeHCO3+ FeCO3 FeCO3+ Fe(CO3)2-2 FeCl+ FeCl2+ FeCl3 FeHSO4+ Fe2(OH)2+4 Fe3(OH)4+5
END
